OldTreasuryMockTests
├── when owner is queried
│   └── it should return the deployer address
├── when a non-owner calls an onlyOwner function
│   └── it should revert with an ownership error
├── when ownership is transferred by a nonOwner
│   └── it should revert with an ownership error
├── when ownership is transferred to the zero address
│   └── it should revert with an invalid address error
└── when ownership is transferred by the owner
    ├── when to a nonZero address
    │   └── it should transfer ownership to the new address
    ├── when the new owner calls an onlyOwner function
    │   └── it should succeed
    └── when the old owner calls an onlyOwner function
        └── it should revert with an ownership error
